{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JOL","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"约珥书","commonName":"约珥书","title":"约珥书","order":29,"numberOfChapters":3,"sha256":"4fea8c005c758b8ea3fc142a25986d04841b2568dee52423510110df5b5a87e8","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JOL/1.json","lastChapterNumber":3,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JOL/3.json","totalNumberOfVerses":73},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["以下是耶和华对毗土珥的儿子约珥所说的话。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["严重的蝗灾"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"长老们啊，要听此言！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"此地所有的居民啊，要留心听！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在你们或你们祖先的时代可曾发生过这样的事？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要把这事告诉你们的子子孙孙，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"传到世世代代！","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"蝗虫吃剩的，蝻子来吃；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"蝻子吃剩的，蚱蜢来吃；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"蚱蜢吃剩的，蚂蚱来吃","poem":1},{"noteId":0},{"text":"。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"醉酒之徒啊，醒过来哭泣吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"贪杯的人啊，哀号吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们再无美酒可饮了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有一群强大的队伍侵犯我的国土，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它们不计其数，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有雄狮的獠牙和母狮的利齿。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它们毁坏我的葡萄树和无花果树，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"剥光树皮，然后丢弃，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"只留下光秃的树枝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"我的子民啊，你们要哀哭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像身披麻衣的少女哭她的未婚夫。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华殿中的素祭和奠祭都停止了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"事奉耶和华的祭司都哀伤。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"田园荒废，遍地凄凉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"五谷尽毁，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再也没有新酒和油了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"农夫啊，你们要忧伤！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"照料葡萄园的人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要哀号！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为田间的大麦和小麦全毁了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"葡萄树枯死，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无花果树凋残，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"石榴树、棕树、苹果树等田野的一切树木枯干。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人间的欢乐消逝了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"祭司啊，披上麻衣痛哭吧；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在祭坛前事奉的人啊，要哀号；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我上帝的仆人啊，要披上麻衣过夜；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为再无素祭和奠祭献到你们上帝的殿中了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"你们要宣布禁食的圣日，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"举行庄严的聚会，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"召集长老和当地所有居民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到你们的上帝耶和华的殿中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向耶和华呼求。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"那日可怕呀！耶和华的日子近了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那是全能者施行毁灭的日子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们亲眼看着粮食断绝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们上帝殿中的欢乐消失。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"种子在土里腐烂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"五谷枯死，仓库荒废，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谷仓被拆毁。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"text":"牲畜哀鸣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"牛群因无草场而彷徨，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"羊群也受苦。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"耶和华啊，我向你呼求，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为火焰吞灭了旷野的草场，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"烈火烧光了田野的树木。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"田野的走兽向你呼求，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为溪水已经枯干，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"火也烧尽了旷野的草场。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"+","text":"“蝗虫、蝻子、蚱蜢和蚂蚱”四个希伯来词语的确切意思很难考证。","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":4}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JOL/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JOL/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/14.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":20}